- `apps/admin/` — admin console at `http://admin.{{HOST}}` (port {{PORT_ADMIN}}). **Distinct trust domain** (BP §9.5, CP §6.1): `ADMIN_JWT_SECRET` (≥32 chars, checked) + audience `{{CODENAME}}-admin`, email-code login against the `ADMIN_EMAILS` allowlist (re-checked on every request), per-IP limits, 12-hour sessions, server-side guard on every page, same nonce CSP as web. Every admin mutation writes its audit entry (actor, action, IP, timestamp, allowlisted before/after) in the same transaction as the change (BP §12, CP §6.8), and gets a test that an unauthorised caller is denied (BP §15).
